### Llistar tots els productes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Obtenir producte per ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### Obtenir producte per ID (un altre)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/3
Accept: application/json

### Crear un producte nou
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Oli d'Oliva",
  "price": 4.75,
  "description": "Oli verge extra 1L",
  "category": "Condiments"
}

### Eliminar un producte
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/2

### Producte inexistent (hauria de retornar 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/999
Accept: application/json

### Verificar que s'ha eliminat (hauria de retornar 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/2
Accept: application/json

### Llistar tots després de les operacions
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products
Accept: application/json
